OL,3,ASouthport survivors' parents
OL,4,A'disgusted' by school recovery funding
OL,5,
OL,6,FParents of children injured in the
OL,7,FSouthport knife attack have criticised
OL,8,F"huge discrepancies" in support money
OL,9,Fgiven to schools in the area after the
OL,10,Fstabbing.
OL,12,FSchools attended by 10 of the survivors
OL,13,Freceived more than a million pounds in
OL,14,Frecovery funding between them, while
OL,15,Fschools attended by 13 other survivors
OL,16,Freceived no direct funding, the
OL,17,Ffamilies' lawyers have said.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
