OL,3,ASouthport survivors' parents
OL,4,A'disgusted' by school recovery funding
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil documents published this
OL,7,Fafternoon reveal that #1,013,920 has
OL,8,Fbeen allocated to seven schools in the
OL,9,FSefton local authority area following
OL,10,Fthe attack in July 2024.
OL,12,FSefton Council said funding was
OL,13,Fallocated in response to specific needs
OL,14,Fidentified by schools and was only part
OL,15,Fof a wider recovery support package.
